{number: 73}
{title: Where He Leads Me}
{key: F}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[F] I can hear my Savior calling,
I can hear my Savior calling,
I can [Bb] hear my Savior calling,
"Take thy [F] cross and [C7] follow, follow [F] Me."
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Where He [F] leads me I will follow,
Where He leads me I will follow,
Where He [Bb] leads me I will follow,
I'll go [F] with Him, [C7] with Him all the [F] way.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
I'll go [F] with Him through the garden,
I'll go with Him through the garden,
I'll go [Bb] with Him through the garden,
I'll go [F] with Him, [C7] with Him all the [F] way.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
I'll go [F] with Him through the judgment,
I'll go with Him through the judgment,
I'll go [Bb] with Him through the judgment,
I'll go [F] with Him, [C7] with Him all the [F] way.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
He will [F] give me grace and glory,
He will give me grace and glory,
He will [Bb] give me grace and glory,
And go [F] with me, [C7] with me all the [F] way.
{end_of_verse}
